config MOTOR_FEEDBACK
	bool "Generic motor feedback sensor"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_MOTOR_FEEDBACK_ENABLED
	select SENSOR
	help
	  Enable the "zephyr,motor-feedback" sensor, a child of a
	  "zephyr,motor" node. It serves the raw feedback of its parent
	  (shaft angle and speed, and the phase currents when measured)
	  through the Zephyr sensor API, using only motor_get_feedback() from
	  the generic motor API. Initializes at SENSOR_INIT_PRIORITY, which
	  must stay above MOTOR_INIT_PRIORITY.
